WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.350
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.620
This never-ending LOOP,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.840
a cycle that goes out of spin,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.270
and runs towards you.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.740
Under this bright sunlight,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.040
and blue sky,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.540
I’m accelerating so fast that I can’t stop moving.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.690
It’s my first time having these feelings.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.450
What should I do? My throbbing heart doesn’t know,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:46.590
and keeps searching for the solution, even now.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.720
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I am here because of your kiss,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.350
which has stopped the flow of time.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.870
I knock on the door to your heart,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.870
and watch your wavering dreams.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Your RUBY eyes are what absorb me in.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.550
Barely in sight,

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:15.880
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.400
Only you...

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.830
my kiss will reach...

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.420
The preliminary synopsis is finally done.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.250
There's something missing though.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.210
We need something that'll grab the audience's heart.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:57.470
Mao-neechan...

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:58.720
Kouichi...

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.390
Hey, are you listening, Sanada?

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.730
Yeah, I'm listening.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.850
Then what's your opinion on this?

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.480
Don't tell me you're fine with this synopsis.

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:18.360
I guess the story needs some work after all.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.950
How should I say it... Something to flare up the leads and create some drama.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.330
Well, drama is important,

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.460
but the people acting will be amateurs.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:29.790
We're not expecting much acting skill out of them.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.500
Here, here!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.130
I think that having a cute mascot character appear is a good idea!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.590
Yeah, yeah!

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:43.850
A mascot, like a kibina frog, similar to Iwao-kun and Juliet.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.020
It'll catch the audience's heart for sure!

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.480
What's that piece of cloth?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.560
Oh, this?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.900
This is Iwao-kun's swimsuit!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.190
I made it for tomorrow's swimming tournament at school so he'd match!

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.450
Me too, me too!

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.070
See, isn't it cute?

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.870
The cut in the chest area makes it daring!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.660
I see, that's it!

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.660
That?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.000
The Kibina frogs?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.330
No, the swimsuits, the swimsuits.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.300
We'll capture the audience's eye by having a service cut.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:22.340
The swimming tournament at school will be the perfect chance for it!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:26.350
We'll find a girl with good style to appear in a swimsuit scene!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.020
Hold on, what are you saying, Hiiragi?!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.270
We have girls here!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.020
No, I'm fine.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.860
I'll help too!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.690
All right, it's settled!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:55.840
Sorry about the weird things that Hiiragi said.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.380
It's okay.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.880
But, I guess boys are interested in girls wearing swimsuits after all.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.800
Well, that's true.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.310
Ah, no, I didn't mean it like that!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.490
Mao-neechan...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:31.660
Ah, I guess this is the first time you've both met him.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.540
This is Kai-kun from my class.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.040
Hello.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:44.010
Things are going pretty well for you too, Kouichi.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.260
Y-You too, Mao-neechan.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.440
Sorry, I think I'm going to go home after all.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:00.690
Okay.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.280
Take care.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.280
Later then. I'll see you tomorrow at school.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:18.920
May I come in, Mao-neechan?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.540
Go on.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.920
You're sure home early today.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.050
Y-Yeah.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.350
Anyway, did you want something?

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.390
Do you want to play racing games again?

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:32.680
No.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:36.020
I left my swimsuit here.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.480
Ah, tomorrow is the swimming tournament, isn't it?

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.980
I've got to prepare too!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.110
Oh yeah, I have a cute swimsuit I bought in France!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.160
Look, look! What do you think?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:53.660
M-Mao-neechan, it's a swimming tournament at school,

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.080
so that's a bit...

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.040
Ah, that's right.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.790
I wonder if the one from two years ago will still fit.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.170
I'm going to try it out, so could you check and see if it looks weird?

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.090
Ah, it's okay after all.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:10.220
There's no point showing you.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.930
Yeah, I should have Kai-kun have a look at times like this.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.270
What's wrong, Mao-neechan?

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.060
Did something happen?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.940
No, nothing happened!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:23.940
Ah, that's right.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.740
It'll be a problem if I forget this.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.820
I can't wear contacts in the pool,

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.200
so I need these.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.160
Dotsuki goggles! ... or something...

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.160
TL Note: dotsuki - to surprise, but can also mean prescription glasses.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:53.300
The tournament is divided into red and white teams that includes all grades with mixed sexes.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.510
You're on the red team, Sanada.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.220
And you're on the white team, Aihara.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.770
Each of you will check the girls on your team,

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.730
and if there's a good looking one,

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:06.690
ask her if you can take a picture with your phone to gather data.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.030
What are you going to do?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.200
I'm on the executive committee for the tournament, so I'm busy.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.200
Well then, I'm counting on you.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.910
What are you two up to?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.000
Kuryuu-san!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:27.630
Don't tell me you're going to take pictures of girls with those?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.470
Ah, no, we won't take pictures secretly.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:34.930
Anyway, it's forbidden to bring cell phones by the poolside.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:38.720
Before the matches start, be sure to put them away in your locker!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.190
If she didn't have that personality,

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.690
Kuryuu would be pretty hot.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.490
Ah, um, this is...

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.950
I was asked to do this by Hiiragi.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:07.420
All right, let's find a nice girl before the matches start.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:09.880
What is it?

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.380
Ah, no.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.970
I thought you'd be absent from these kind of events.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:18.430
I just felt like coming.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:19.720
Don't worry about it.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.650
Certain Victory for White

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.530
Asuka-senpai!

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.160
She's so cool!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.870
As expected from her.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.290
Yeah.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.050
Sakino-san is amazing.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.630
Kuryuu-san from our team is doing her best too.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.310
Girl's 50m Freestyle,

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.940
First place, white team, 2-C's Sakino Asuka.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.200
Sakino-senpai is really amazing though.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.830
She got first place in most of the events.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.790
She almost got all of her team's points.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.550
Well, sports is her only merit.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.380
She can only stand out at times like these.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.680
What do you mean, "only stand out at times like these?"

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.810
Asuka-senpai, for the matches in the afternoon,

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.980
please regain your stamina with these special udon lunch boxes I made!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.270
Everyone else please have some!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.270
Udon lunch box?

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.400
I went through a lot in order for the noodles to not get soggy, regardless of the time.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.950
The noodles and broth are separate.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:02.080
I thought of various ways to make it nutritionally balanced.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.040
It looks good!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.410
I guess I'll try some then. Let's see...

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:10.870
How is it?

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.660
Yeah, it's good!

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.080
You're right, it's pretty good.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:19.330
It might be even good enough to be on Satonaka's menu.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:21.130
Really?!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:23.670
Yeah, this is seriously good.

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:25.220
Futami-san!

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:28.180
Hey, hey! Have a taste of this.

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:32.180
I'm sure you'll think it's delicious.

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.190
Another experiment for bad taste?

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.940
Please have some, Futami-senpai.

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:47.820
What do you think? Good, right?

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.790
It's as good as the one I ate at Satonaka Udon.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.370
Perhaps it's as good as the berry-berry ramen, too.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:58.720
Narumi's Udon = Really Terrible Ramen

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.710
Don't feel down, Naru-chan!

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.090
By the way, aren't you going to swim, Futami-san?

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.510
I won't be participating in any matches.

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:15.850
You don't look like the type who'd be good at swimming.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.350
I've read about all the swimming styles in books:

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.980
the crawl, breaststroke, butterfly.

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.610
I understand it all in general.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.610
But understanding it conceptually,

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:29.910
and actually swimming is different.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:31.360
Is that so?

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:36.290
Yep! Like the feeling of floating on the water,

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:38.960
and the exhilaration you feel from stroking it.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.710
You won't understand it if it's all in your head.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:45.130
They are simply following the laws of physics when floating on water.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:47.800
It's nothing more or less than that.

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:50.760
There's no real need to do experiments.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:54.510
Experiments? It's not about physics and science.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.100
It is about physics and science.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.270
Don't you know the term "sports science?"

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:23.260
Certain Victory for White

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:36.720
Girl's 100m freestyle,

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:41.100
first place, red team, 1-B's Yuzuki Haruko.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:48.280
Second Place, red team, 1-C's Hiba Manami.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:52.530
It looks like Mao-neechan is feeling down after all.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.200
I wonder what's wrong?

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:57.200
Next up is the boys' 100m freestyle,

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.410
It's your turn, Sanada-kun.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:02.330
Good luck!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.920
Y-Yeah.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:20.470
Could something have happened between her and Kai-san?

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:23.230
Well then, on your marks.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.040
Kouichi!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.310
School Infirmary

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.430
It's nothing serious.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.850
What happened though? Anemia?

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:04.810
No, these are dotsuki goggles.

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:08.770
TL Note: dotsuki - a fisherman's tool as well.

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:08.770
Dotsuki?

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.280
I probably took the wrong ones yesterday.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:14.530
I should return these to Mao-neechan.

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:16.950
Ah, so they belong to Mizusawa-san.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.700
So, she's near-sighted?

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.990
I'll give them to her then.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:25.500
You stay here and rest up a bit more.

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:42.470
I was in a panic, so I went like this.

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.900
If you're okay with my parker then-

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:51.820
You have a wound on your forehead too.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:17.340
So are you all right, Kouichi?

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:26.270
Was I in the way of something?

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.350
No, it's nothing like that!

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:29.730
What about you?

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:33.860
She was a bit too enthusiastic and got a cramp in her leg.

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:36.360
Sakino-san!

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.610
This is nothing!

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:40.860
I'm still needed for one of the events.

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.160
You're not fine at all.

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.200
That's right, you shouldn't push yourself!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:49.290
Well, just leave the rest to me.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:51.290
I'll do my best, including your share.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.220
On your marks.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.180
Ready.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.850
False start, you're disqualified.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:17.440
Well, he's that kind of guy when there's something important on the line...

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.490
Onii-chan!

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.780
We need Asuka-senpai after all!

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:25.030
The scores are becoming closer, too.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.300
Red

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.300
White

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.450
Final event,

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:32.080
for all those participating in the mixed relay, please gather around the start line.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:36.840
I believe Sakino-san is supposed to be in the next event.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.510
Then if she doesn't participate,

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.260
does that mean we'll win?

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.050
Isn't there anyone who can fill in?

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:48.220
But the butterfly event isn't something anyone can do.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.680
What should we do?

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.730
I'll do it.

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.190
I'm fine now.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:56.230
Asuka-senpai!

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.400
Your leg is still cramped!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.780
Even if I can't use my legs,

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.660
I'll be able to swim with only my arms.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.410
Don't push yourself, it's better if you sit out.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:10.700
Let's go tell the teacher we'll forfeit this match.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.420
Even though we've gotten this far?

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.790
Do you want to lose?

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:21.130
It can't be helped if there's no one to fill in for you.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:25.550
Futami-san?

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:32.390
If I recall, Futami-senpai said she understood it all by reading books.

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.480
Then that means she's okay with the butterfly, too?

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.400
She can fill in for Asuka-senpai!

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:39.020
It's best if you don't participate.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.450
You'll lose for sure with that leg.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:47.570
If you're going to lose, there is no need to compete in the first place.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:48.580
It's pointless.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:52.660
You won't know if you're going to win or lose until you do it!

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:53.750
I know without having to do it.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:55.920
No, you don't know!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.170
I'll prove it to you!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:03.050
For those participating in the mixed relay,

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.300
please gather around the start line.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:13.600
On your marks.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:17.230
Ready!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.010
Kibina High School Swimming Tournament Club Champion

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.710
She really won...

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.920
You're amazing, Asuka-senpai!

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.920
I was deeply moved!

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:47.590
I'll follow you anywhere!

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:51.100
It might have been because of your special udon.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:57.690
Oh no, the atmosphere is becoming stiff again!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.070
Well, things like this happen too.

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:06.240
I was surprised too!

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:09.320
Who'd have thought she'd really win-

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:09.320
Amazing.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.700
I think it's amazing.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.000
Futami-san!

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.390
It's fine that everyone's experiencing some youthful drama but...

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:38.640
Did you find any girls that could appear in the swimsuit scene?

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.150
That's right, I completely forgot!

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:42.940
What about you, Sanada?

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.190
Ah, me too.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:48.070
You were probably looking at Hoshino-san the whole time.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:50.780
What were you two doing in the infirmary?

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.120
I-Idiot!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:53.910
Ah, that's right...

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.950
I forgot my parker in the infirmary!

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:57.950
I'm going to go get it!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:02.040
Geez, what a helpless guy.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.920
U-Um...

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.840
A swimsuit, right?

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:10.680
I was looking around.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.560
How about 3-C's Shinjou-kun?

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.930
I think he had a well toned body!

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:24.150
Ah, that's a bit...

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:25.900
Eh? He's no good?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:39.790
Mao-neechan!

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.540
Kouichi.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:43.540
Sorry about the goggles.

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:46.380
I took the wrong ones.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:47.460
Oh, it's okay.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.380
Anyway, are you okay?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.930
It seemed like you were in a daze all day.

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:56.140
Mao-neechan?

00:20:58.350 --> 00:20:59.350
It's nothing.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:01.810
It only looked like that.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:06.110
You know, I had my contacts off because of the pool.

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:08.190
Being near-sighted sure is terrible.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:09.940
That's fine then.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.780
That's right, my contact!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.280
Don't move, Kouichi!

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.830
Could it be you...

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:21.330
You dropped your contact?!

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:22.410
That's right!

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:25.120
Where did it go?!

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.000
It's better if you don't move around, Mao-neechan.

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.380
You can't see well, right?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.470
Stay still, I'll look for it.

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.980
kowaresou de

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.980
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:38.940
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:38.940
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.650
wasarenai yo

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.650
I won’t forget

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:47.410
hoshi ni negai o

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:47.410
that wish upon a star.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:22:00.130
kyou shitsu no sumi ni wa itsumo fushigi bako

00:21:55.620 --> 00:22:00.130
The strange box lying in the corner of the classroom;

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.500
dare ni mo misenai shi

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.500
I won’t show it to anyone.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.300
itsumo minai furi

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.300
I always pretend not to see it.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:11.220
hajimete okutte moratta hoshi no yoru

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:11.220
The first time you walked me home during that starry night.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.600
ano kajitsu mo

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.600
The fruit

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.180
mada tabetenai kedo

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.180
I have not eaten.

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.020
honki de butsukatta

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.020
I struck it with all my might.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.810
naite sawaida

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.810
I cried and I screamed.

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:30.320
shinkei wa kitto kinui totokoutetsu de dekiteta

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:30.320
I’m certain nerves are made from silk and steel.

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:32.950
osaekirenai

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:32.950
My insuppressible feelings

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.960
omoi o nagete negai boshi ni

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.960
are cast on a wishing star.

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:38.580
ima kakeru yo

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:38.580
It’s now time to run.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:42.000
tobira no soto wa DAIAMONDO

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:42.000
Beyond the door are diamonds.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:47.970
ikusen no yume kaki utsushita NOOTO ni

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:47.970
Thousands of dreams transcribed onto a notebook.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.050
tojikometara ai ni yuku yo

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.050
Whenever I’m trapped I’m go see you.

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:59.020
kirakira toeien o kiritotta mamade

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:59.020
The sparkle and eternity are cut short.

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.980
yakusoku shita kimi to nara ano hi no KISU o

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.980
We made a promise with a kiss on that day.

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.030
kowaresou de

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.030
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.990
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.990
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:13.070
wasurenai yo

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:13.070
I won’t forget

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:19.040
hoshi ni negai o

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:19.040
that wish upon a star.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:40.060
Next Episode

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:29.420
Is there something worrying you, Mizusawa?

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:32.560
If you have any worries, I'd like it if you confided in me.

00:23:33.060 --> 00:23:34.930
No matter what it is, I want to hear about it.

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:36.980
Sanada Kouichi?

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:38.820
What did you want to talk to me about?
